<title>USA: Coventry sells dental plan for $5.5 mln.</title>
<headline>Coventry sells dental plan for $5.5 mln.</headline>
<dateline>NASHVILLE, Tenn. 1997-01-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Coventry Corp said Friday it has completed a deal selling its Champion Dental managed care plan to First Commonwealth Inc for $5.5 million.</p>
<p>Champion Dental provides services to 60,000 members and generated about $2.2 million in annual revenues.</p>
